   "texto": [
    "**上面** is above; **下面**, below; **里面**, inside; **外面**, outside; **前面**, ahead; **后面**, behind; **旁边**, next; **中间**, in between. In Spanish, prepositions usually go before the name; in Mandarin, these words of place often go later."
